{"id": "3257675", "revid": "473052", "url": "https://ro.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3257675", "title": "Shai Gilgeous-Alexander", "text": "Shaivonte Aician Gilgeous-Alexander () este un baschetbalist canadian care evolueaz\u0103 pentru Oklahoma City Thunder \u00een National Basketball Association. \u00cen 2025, SGA a fost numit MVP-ul competi\u021biei. \u00cen acel sezon 2024\u201325, el a condus Thunder c\u0103tre primul lor campionat de la mutarea de la Seattle la Oklahoma City. El a devenit al doilea canadian care a c\u00e2\u0219tigat premiul MVP, dup\u0103 Steve Nash. \u00cen 2023, a primit premiul Sportivul Anului \u00een Canada. \nLeg\u0103turi externe.\n "}
